The Ur-Quan Masters derives from the Toys for Bob 3DO version of Star Control II,
released with their permission and encouragement.

This checkout now builds the game entirely in Rust. See ../README.md and
../dev-docs/rust/howtorun.md for current build and run instructions.

Upstream project: https://sc2.sourceforge.net/
